      "note": "Yamaha MG10XU technical data sheet (opened, copy hosted by la-bs.com): 4 mic inputs (combo jack, XLR / TRS, 48 V phantom) on mono channels 1-4, 10 line inputs (4 mono + 3 stereo pairs, phone jacks and RCA pins), stereo outputs on XLR-3-32 and phone jacks, monitor out, aux / FX send, stereo phone jack for headphones, USB standard-B (2 in / 2 out); the mixer is supplied from an external PA-10 adaptor, so no mains inlet is modelled. Modelled subset: 4 combos (XLR part), one stereo line pair, one RCA pair, XLR main L / R, phones, USB; the monitor out, aux send and foot switch are not modelled. Size 244 x 294 x 71 mm (W x D x H, labelled). Slab profile is an estimate: the sources give only the outer sizes (rear height at the io edge, a lower front lip); the real desk is not a straight wedge. Positions of connectors on the rear face are guesses; the top picture is a generic strip layout."
